# Docker uploads the whole build context to the daemon before any COPY runs. The
# Dockerfiles copy explicit file lists, so none of this could enter an image, but
# without this file `docker build .` still sends it all: the venv and the market
# data caches are ~2 GB, and .env (the broker keys) would leave the directory.
# Nothing listed here is copied by any Dockerfile.
.git
.venv
.cache
.env
.env.*
core-state
outbox
state
**/__pycache__
.pytest_cache
.ruff_cache
.claude
